<title>USA: General Employment opens new offices.</title>
<headline>General Employment opens new offices.</headline>
<dateline>OAKBROOK TERRACE, Ill. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Employment Enterprises Inc said Monday it opened two new offices, one in Dallas, Texas and the other in Memphis, Tennessee.</p>
<p>With these offices, General Employment has opened nine new locations. This compares with its previously announced plans to open eight branch offices during fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>Earlier this year, the company said it planned to open an additional 12 offices in fiscal 1998 and 16 branches during fiscal 1999.</p>
<p>(( -- Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
